<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1567181552"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:34.386"><div begin="28.577" end="55.126" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="28.577" end="33.975" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.577" end="28.788">我</span><span begin="28.788" end="29.547">曾想</span><span begin="29.547" end="30.163">带</span><span begin="30.163" end="30.398">你</span><span begin="30.398" end="31.013">走</span><span begin="31.013" end="31.212">到</span><span begin="31.212" end="31.858">世</span><span begin="31.858" end="32.124">界</span><span begin="32.124" end="32.683">的</span><span begin="32.683" end="32.974">边</span><span begin="32.974" end="33.975">缘</span></p><p begin="35.481" end="40.985" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.481" end="35.706">我</span><span begin="35.706" end="36.439">曾想</span><span begin="36.439" end="36.936">忘</span><span begin="36.936" end="37.205">记</span><span begin="37.205" end="37.797">一</span><span begin="37.797" end="38.125">切</span><span begin="38.125" end="38.849">和你</span><span begin="39.136" end="40.147">走到终</span><span begin="40.147" end="40.985">点</span></p><p begin="41.404" end="47.084" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.404" end="42.108">但也</span><span begin="42.108" end="42.440">抵</span><span begin="42.440" end="43.011">不</span><span begin="43.011" end="43.309">过</span><span begin="43.309" end="43.915">你</span><span begin="43.915" end="44.092">的</span><span begin="44.092" end="44.975">心里</span><span begin="45.043" end="46.260">思绪万</span><span begin="46.260" end="47.084">千</span></p><p begin="48.259" end="55.126" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.259" end="48.553">这</span><span begin="48.553" end="49.662">可能就</span><span begin="49.662" end="51.044">叫</span><span begin="51.904" end="53.536">相拥也难</span><span begin="53.536" end="55.126">眠</span></p></div><div begin="55.980" end="1:30.572" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="55.980" end="1:02.711" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.98